<div class="section"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-shape-left---content-right service-details-card"><div class="max-w-520px max-w-100-tablet"><div class="flex-horizontal align-end reveal-on-scroll"><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _05"><img alt="" src="/images/68d2a01dec269aadef69b570_podcast-2.webp"/></div></div></div><div class="max-w-490px tablet-max-w-100 reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-_050bb908-f339-f8ae-2a48-f24355c22b20-db0a851d"><h2 class="display-2 mg-bottom-12px"><strong>Podcast Placements &amp; Partnerships</strong></h2><p class="mg-bottom-32px mg-bottom-24px-tablet">Podcasts are no longer niche—they’re where business leaders, investors, and decision-makers go for trusted insights. We get our clients into those conversations.</p><h2 class="heading-h4-size"><strong>What We Deliver</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Strategic Targeting</strong>: We identify the podcasts that your investors, customers, and industry stakeholders actually listen to.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Placements</strong>: We secure interviews and features that put your CEO or brand in front of the right ears.</li><li><strong>Amplification</strong>: Every placement is repurposed into clips, posts, newsletters, and investor materials—so you get exponential ROI from a single interview.</li></ul></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section pd-top-0px pb-0"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-shape-right---content-left"><div class="max-w-540px tablet-max-w-100 reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-_6748fd4b-d27e-14fa-bd9e-f25ec98f1cf2-db0a851d"><h2 class="display-2 mg-bottom-12px"><strong>Journalist Campaigns</strong></h2><p class="mg-bottom-32px">Journalists shape the headlines your investors, customers, and industry stakeholders rely on. We build targeted journalist campaigns that ensure your story lands where it matters most.</p><h2 class="heading-h4-size"><strong>What We Deliver</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Targeted Outreach: </strong>Direct engagement with journalists already covering your sector—crypto, capital markets, health innovation, and more.</li><li><strong>Story Angles That Stick: </strong>Narrative development that ties your brand to the news cycle and positions your leaders as trusted sources.</li><li><strong>Amplified Impact:</strong> Each placement is repurposed across newsletters, social media, and investor updates, extending the reach and ROI.</li></ul></div><div class="max-w-520px max-w-100-tablet" id="w-node-e56c4b04-c574-40c0-4e5d-0eb00aab7614-db0a851d"><div class="flex-horizontal align-start reveal-on-scroll"><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _05"><img alt="" src="/images/68d29ef96dd3fe24ba4202ee_journals.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-shape-left---content-right service-details-card"><div class="max-w-520px max-w-100-tablet"><div class="flex-horizontal align-end reveal-on-scroll"><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _05"><img alt="" src="/images/68d29ef9d7d9a647c9ba104d_report.webp"/></div></div></div><div class="max-w-490px tablet-max-w-100 reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-ceca2ea5-051c-3376-86ab-225307da8a81-db0a851d"><h2 class="display-2 mg-bottom-12px"><strong>Research &amp; Growth Reports</strong></h2><p class="mg-bottom-32px mg-bottom-24px-tablet">Every serious investor asks: <em>“Why should I put my money here instead of somewhere else?”</em> Our Growth &amp; Market Reports answer that question with authority.</p><h2 class="heading-h4-size"><strong>What We Deliver</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Company-Specific Reports: </strong>Benchmark your company against peers, highlight differentiators, and position you in the strongest possible light.</li><li><strong>Market Landscape Analysis: </strong>Clear, independent research that provides investors with confidence and clarity.</li><li><strong>Shareholder Assets: </strong>Reports double as communication tools—use them in decks, IR campaigns, or capital-raising roadshows.</li></ul></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section pd-top-0px pb-0"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-shape-right---content-left"><div class="max-w-540px tablet-max-w-100 reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-_8d25a284-ae0b-f7b5-d35b-d1747af5e7db-db0a851d"><h2 class="display-2 mg-bottom-12px"><strong>Conversations with CEOs</strong></h2><p class="mg-bottom-32px">We don’t just interview CEOs—we craft strategic dialogues that position leaders as visionaries while capturing insights that fuel broader campaigns.</p><h2 class="heading-h4-size"><strong>What We Deliver</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Professional Interviews: </strong>High-quality, strategic conversations that highlight a leader’s story, vision, and values.</li><li><strong>Repurposable Content: </strong>Video, audio, transcripts, and quotes that can be deployed across LinkedIn, investor decks, or internal culture-building.</li><li><strong>Relationship Capital: </strong>Each interview strengthens networks and creates touchpoints with peers, investors, and markets.</li></ul></div><div class="max-w-520px max-w-100-tablet" id="w-node-_8d25a284-ae0b-f7b5-d35b-d1747af5e7f1-db0a851d"><div class="flex-horizontal align-start reveal-on-scroll"><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _05"><img alt="" src="/images/68d29df567c5c04f216befbd_podcast.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section overflow-hidden"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-2-columns title-and-paragraph"><div class="max-w-480px reveal-on-scroll"><h2 class="display-2 mg-bottom-0"><strong>How It All Fits Together</strong></h2></div><div class="reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-cae7c238-37f9-b317-a42a-3d69d2161617-db0a851d"><a class="btn-primary w-button" href="/contact">Get in touch<span class="line-rounded-icon link-icon-right"></span></a></div></div><div class="grid-visit-offices"><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _05" id="w-node-_2c1a8c8d-9aa5-519b-e33e-475fd2924cf1-db0a851d"><img alt="" class="_w-h-100" src="/images/68ca563afe01c79b90bcde6a_toronto.webp"/></div><div id="w-node-_2c1a8c8d-9aa5-519b-e33e-475fd2924cf3-db0a851d"><p class="mg-bottom-24px">We start small to deliver quick wins—whether it’s a single podcast appearance or a high-impact report. Each deliverable is designed to unlock insights, revealing opportunities for deeper work. From there, we scale with strategy, turning one-off successes into a consistent, long-term advantage in the market.</p><ul role="list"><li><strong>Start Small, Win Big: </strong>Most clients begin with a podcast or report.</li><li><strong>Unlock Insights: </strong>Deliverables highlight where deeper work is needed.</li><li><strong>Scale With Strategy: </strong>Advisory transforms one-off wins into lasting market advantage.</li></ul></div></div></div></div>
